	(text "System-5 CPU card, Rev D (2026): CDP1802 at 2 MHz, 2732 boot EPROM (HBIOS) at F000-FFFF, on the 36-pin bus (docs/manual/bus.md, the 36-pin extension)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "00c1a2de-8208-5ed4-b96d-bb20360811d8"))
	(text "Clock: X1 4 MHz / 2 (U4A) or EXT_CLK from the debug header J2, picked by JP1. Modes: CLEAR = -RESET, WAIT = -PAUSE (U7, Schmitt). DMA_IN = -DMAIN once DMA_ARMED (U8B): paused, and -DMAIN seen high since (U11C, U11D, U9A)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a1bf4e4-bf80-54cf-803b-bf3ef0d4fe27"))
	(text "Reset: U10 DS1813 on -RESET (no watchdog). A boot reset = -RESET and -DMAIN low with -PAUSE high: SW1 RESET/RUN and power-on (U12 DS1813 on SW_RST) make it through U11A / U11B (74HC03, open drain)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f8e4f992-efef-5b18-b1f3-bc5059cc088f"))
	(text "Boot map: after a reset the EPROM answers everywhere (-VMA high) until the first A15 access (U4B), unless LOADED (U8A, set by LOAD mode, cleared by a boot reset, BOOT_L from U6B; LED6 RAM, on its Q output through R8, is lit while it is set)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c579251b-e60c-59c9-9c71-d8086d269773"))
	(text "Flags: JP2-JP5, one 2x4 block per flag input EF1-EF4, each row a bus flag line (-EF1, -EF2, -EF3, -EF). SC0 to the bus (position 35) and J2. Design notes: ../DESIGN.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a20f7e4-402e-5861-87ae-ded7146801f2"))
	(text "Generated by gen/make_schematic.py from gen/netlist.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d36f8c03-46fd-59cd-8daf-a40d275529d3"))
